{"id":"isla","lemma":"isla","pos":"noun","rank":885,"glosses":["island (area of land surrounded by water)","block (group of urban lots of property)"],"ipa":"/ˈisla/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"islas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-isla.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sumatra es una isla.","en":"Sumatra is an island.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/36007"},{"text":"Hay muchas islas en Grecia.","en":"There are many islands in Greece.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932171"},{"text":"La isla está deshabitada.","en":"The island is uninhabited.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1086498"},{"text":"España gobernó las Islas Filipinas en otro tiempo.","en":"Spain once governed the Philippine Islands.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926299"},{"text":"La isla estaba completamente desierta.","en":"The island was completely deserted.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/298606"}]}